 ## Operating characteristics
-- **Time Complexity:** Reduces the number of fine MLP evaluations. On the Blender 'lego' scene (800x800), using layer 1 achieved a 34.69% speedup with 40% of rays processed by the fine pass [S1]. Using layer 3 achieved a 55% speedup with 47% of rays processed by the fine pass [S1].
-- **Memory Complexity:** Requires storing intermediate activations for all rays to compute the mean threshold $\tau$ [S1].
-- **Measured Performance:**
-  - Layer 1: PSNR 29.66, SSIM 0.93, LPIPS 0.04 [S1].
-  - Layer 3: PSNR 31.21, SSIM 0.95, LPIPS 0.02 [S1].
-  - Full NeRF: PSNR 32.20, SSIM 0.96, LPIPS 0.02 [S1].
-- **Strengths:** Significant performance improvement with negligible image quality loss on synthetic scenes with transparent backgrounds [S1].
-- **Limitations:** Fails on real-world scenes with detailed backgrounds [S1].
+- **Speedup:** On the Blender 'lego' scene (800x800), using layer 1 achieved a 34.69% speedup with 40% of rays processed by the fine pass. Using layer 3 achieved a 55% speedup with 47% of rays processed by the fine pass. [S1]
+- **Quality:** On the same scene, layer 1 resulted in PSNR 29.66, SSIM 0.93, LPIPS 0.04. Layer 3 resulted in PSNR 31.21, SSIM 0.95, LPIPS 0.02. The full NeRF baseline had PSNR 32.20, SSIM 0.96, LPIPS 0.02. [S1]
+- **Scaling:** Performance gains are more substantial when applying the method to earlier layers (e.g., layer 1 vs layer 3). [S1]
+- **Limitations:** The method relies on transparent backgrounds found in synthetic scenes. It fails on real-world scenes with detailed backgrounds. [S1]
 
 ## Background
-Originated in the analysis of neural radiance field internals, specifically leveraging the observation that intermediate activations contain notable structural information and correlate with density [S1]. The method was applied to NeRF and Mip-NeRF models [S1].
+This method was introduced in "Analyzing the Internals of Neural Radiance Fields" (2024). It builds on the observation that intermediate activations in NeRF MLPs contain structural information about density. The approach was tested on NeRF and Mip-NeRF models, including proposal network samplers like nerfacto. [S1]
 
